      "Legacy"
    ]
  },
  "description": "Render Zebra ZPL II labels to PDF on top of EgoPDF.Generator and ZXing.Net. Supports ^XA/^XZ, ^FO/^FT/^FD/^FS, ^A?, ^CF, ^GB/^GC/^GE/^GD, ^GF inline bitmaps, ^XG host graphic recall, ^FB wrap, and the Code 128 / Code 39 / Code 93 / Interleaved 2 of 5 / Codabar / EAN-13 / EAN-8 / UPC-A / UPC-E / MSI / QR Code / Data Matrix / PDF417 / Aztec barcodes. Targets net8.0 and net9.0. Preview release — API and rendering output may change without notice.",
